<!-- BEGIN custom:introduction -->
# cargo-cicd

`cargo-cicd` is a local-first CI/CD helper for Rust workspaces.
<!-- END custom:introduction -->

## Install

```sh
cargo install cargo-cicd
```

## Usage

```sh
cargo cicd <command>
```

